('Noise, weight, and privacy', P('Electric devices are often heavier and louder than simple sleeves. Noise depends on motor type, speed, grip, lubricant amount, and whether the device rests on a hard surface. If privacy matters, read reviews that mention apartment use, roommates, or late-night sound rather than trusting a single quiet label.', 'Privacy also includes packaging, billing, and storage. A larger powered device may need a discreet box or pouch, especially if it has a charger and sleeve accessories. If the product uses an app, review permissions, account requirements, and whether partner controls are opt-in and easy to revoke.')),
